1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hilda Warbrick''' (née '''Cottam'''; August 29, 1937 – June 23, 2023) was a British shorthand typist, medical records officer and newsagent best remembered as the maternal grandmother of the philosopher and foun
2 CONC der of Astronism, Cometan. Hilda married her husband William "Bill" Warbrick on 17th May 1958. Hilda died at her beloved home Brooklands on Quaker Brook Lane on the morning of the 23rd June 2023 with her grandson Cometan and her h
2 CONC usband Bill by her side.
