1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Francis "Frank" McMellon''' (April 2, 1892 – February 20, 1976) was an English painter and educator who taught at St Mary's Boys School in Bamber Bridge and was instrumental to development of educational facilit
2 CONC ies and opportunities in Bamber Bridge and many surrounding villages in the first half of the 20th century. Francis is also remembered as an exquisite artist, having painted several landscapes of Lancashire countryside.
