2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Daniel and Lydia Grinnell..
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Rebecca (Grinnell) Doud had the following (3) children:[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT # John, b. 28 Feb. 1725/6; m. Temperance Chapman
2 CONT # Samuel, b. ca. 23 Feb. 1729/30; m. Lydia Lay
2 CONT # Peleg, baptized 10 Feb. 1733/4; m. Merab Ward
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Grinnell, John Doud’s widow,  married 13 Feb 1741/1742 to Gideon Wellman as 2nd wife.  Gideon and Rebecca (Grinnell) Doud Wellman did not have any children. 
