2 CONT
2 CONT ===Daniel Grinnell===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 11 Jan 1707 in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Daniel Grinnell and Lydia (Pabodie) Grinnell
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Mary (Grinnell) Lay, Elizabeth (Grinnell) Stevens, Priscilla (Grinnell) Redfield, Paybody Grinnell, Lydia (Grinnell) Clark, Sarah (Grinnell) Nettleton, Rebecca (Grinnell) Wellman, George Grinnell and Jemima (Grinnell) C
2 CONC halker
2 CONT
2 CONT [spouse(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT [children unknown]
2 CONT Died before Nov 1726 at about age 19 in Old Saybrook Twp, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Grinnell-37 created 31 Mar 2011 | Last modified 14 Jul 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Death date may have been July 11, 1708, died young, in Saybrook (Westbrook) Middlesex, CT. by anonymous Purcell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Grinnell was born 1 on 11 Jan 1707/1708 in Westbrook, Middlesex Co., CT. He died before Nov 1726
2 CONT
