2 CONT
2 CONT “The Family of William Leete: One of the First Settlers of Guilford, Conn ...” edited by Alvan Talcott.  Page 16.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=WAQxAAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA16&ots=A-EjFDHUOm&dq=Ebenezer%20Stone%201676%20leete&pg=PA16#
2 CONC v=onepage&q=Ebenezer%20Stone%201676%20leete&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT >23 Stone Abigail Leete, dau. of Andrew (3), m. as 2d wife, Abraham Bradley, of Guilford. He died Apr. 20, 1721, aged 47. She m. 2d, as 2d wife, about 1725, Ebenezer Stone, son of Lieut. Nathaniel Stone, of Guilford, born Aug. 21,
2 CONC  1676. He died, aged 85, Aug. 18, 1761. She died, aged 84, Apr. 16,  1767.  Child by last marriage: Abigail, b. Oct. 2, 1726, d. Nov. 23, 1783.
2 CONT
