2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was the daughter of Steuen Broadley and Hannah Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married first Isaac Griswold on 31 Dec 1672 in CT - parents of Michael, Richard, Hannah, Elizabeth & Isaac
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Isaac, she married Sgt. William Wellman II
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away in 1732 and is buried at Indian River Cem, Clinton, Middlesex, CT
2 CONT
