2 CONT ===Elizabeth  (Bradley) Wellman (1671 - 1732)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Wellman formerly Bradley aka Griswold
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 31 Dec 1671 in Guilford, New Haven, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Stephen (Broadley) Bradley and Hannah (Smith) Bradley
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Hannah (Bradley) Bishop, Sarah Bradley, Stephen Bradley Jr., Daniel Bradley, Abraham Bradley and Sarah (Bradley) Griswold
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Isaac Griswold — married 31 Dec 1672 in Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of William Wellman II — married 25 Jun 1730 in Killingworth, Middlesex County, Connecticu
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Michael Griswold, Elizabeth (Griswold) Hull and Isaac Griswold
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 27 Oct 1732 in Killingworth, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Smyth, Hon. Ralph D., The Bradleys of New Haven and Guilford (Conn.), The New England Historical & Genealogical Register (NEHGS, Boston, Mass., 1903) Vol. 57, Page 135.
