2 CONT Townsend, Charles Delmar. The Griswold Family, England-America (Tuttle Pub. Co., Griswold Family Association of America, 1935-) Vol. 2
2 CONT Peters, Eleanor Bradley. Bradley of Essex County, Early Records: from 1643 to 1746 (The Knickerbocker Press, New York, 1915) Page 193.
2 CONT CT Town Birth Records
2 CONT CT Town Marriage Records
