1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Norton-5874
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was the eldest child and first daughter of Daniel & Sarah (Bradley) Norton
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married Joseph Chittenden, son of Joseph and Patience (Stone) Chittenden, about 1749 at Guilford, New Haven, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT After her death, Joseph married twice more; Rhoda Bishop, daughter of Nathaniel and Abigail (Stone) Bishop, on 28 Oct 1761 at Guilford, New Haven, CT, and later to Carine Ward on 15 Dec 1772 at Guilford, New Haven, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born in 1731. She was the daughter of Daniel Norton. She passed away in 1761.
