2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Mary Grinnell was the great-great-grandmother of Moses Hicks Grinnell, a prominent citizen of New York City. (Source: Geni.)  
2 CONT Mary is a descendant of 10 signers of the Magna Carta in 1215.Please see "The Descendants of Matthew and Rose (French) Greenell", part 1 (of 3), pg. 3.
