1 NOTE {geni:about_me} note found on findagrave.com 7/2/2014:
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Daniel Greenell and Mary Wodell. He and wife Patience Emery had children George, William, Rebecca S., Elizabeth, Patience, Richard, Ruth, Daniel, Sarah, and Comfort. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?id=mWsoAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA244&ots=Hl3akZe7RO&dq=patience%20emery%201681%20grinnell&pg=PA244#v=onepage&q=patience%20emery%201681%20grinnell&f=false The Howland heirs:] being the story of a family and a 
2 CONC fortune and the inheritance of a trust established for Mrs. Hetty H. R. Green (Google eBook) William Morrell Emery. E. Anthony and Sons, inc., 1919 - 484 pages.  Page 244.  "Richard7 Grinnell, b. 1675; d. July 1, 1725, in Little C
2 CONC ompton, where he was a substantial man of affairs, a large land holder, and appointed to keep the ordinary; m. May 25,1704, Patience Emery, b. 1681, d. March 10, 1749. Nine children."
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
