2 CONT
2 CONT ===Jonathan Grinnell===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 18 May 1670 in Portsmouth, Newport, Rhode Island [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Daniel Grinnell and Mary (Wodell) Grinnell
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Daniel Grinnell and Richard Grinnell
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail (Ford) Grinnell — married 8 Dec 1698 in Little Compton, Newport, Rhode Island
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Hope Grinnell, Sarah Grinnell, Daniel Grinnell, Mary Grinnell and Jonathan Grinnell
2 CONT
2 CONT Died about 1742 at about age 71 in Little Compton, Newport, Rhode Island [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 15 Jun 2020 | Created 31 Mar 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the Mayflower Silver Book for Richard Warren, Abigail Ford and Jonathan Grinnell had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hope Grinnell, born 18 July 1699
2 CONT Sarah Grinnell, born 11 April 1703
2 CONT Daniel Grinnell, born 18 November 1705
2 CONT Mary Grinnell, born 12 March 1709
2 CONT Jonathan Grinnell, born 7 February 1710/1
2 CONT Also according to the Mayflower Silver Book, Stephen (born 18 July 1715) and Rebecca (22 April 1718) are not the children of this couple.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Grinnell married Abigail Ford on 08 Dec 1698 in Little Compton,Newport,Rhode Island[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail and Jonathan are named in the birth record of their daughters, Hope, Sarah, Rebecca, Mary and sons Daniel. and Stephen[2][3][4][5][6][7][8]
