0 @I6000000012665228039@ INDI
1 NAME Elisabeth /Alden/
2 GIVN Elisabeth
2 SURN Alden
2 _MARNM Pabodie
2 NICK Betty Alden
2 NICK Elizabeth (Alden) Pabodie Peabody
