1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brooker
2 CONT
2 CONT         2.   John Brooker, son of John and Mary, was born 9 July 1695.  He married 29 April 1717 Sarah                    Grinnell.  Lived in Saybrook, Conn.
2 CONT               Children:
2 CONT                     John, b 1 July 1718
2 CONT                     Samuel
2 CONT                     Mary
2 CONT                     Sarah
2 CONT                     Patience, mar Gideon Allen (, Jr. Killingworth Vital Records Vol 2  p. 120) (Famillies of Early Guilford Connecticut  p. 152)
2 CONT
2 CONT     2:410       John Brooker & Sarah Greenell were Maryed Each to other ye 
2 CONT                     29 Day of Aprill Anno Domini                                                                            1717
2 CONT                    *John Brooker Son of John & Sarah Brooker was born ye 21st of July            1718
2 CONT                     Samuell their Son was Born ye 28th day of May                                             1720
2 CONT                     Mary & Sarah their Daughters were born the 22d day of March                      1723
2 CONT                     Sarah their Daughter Dyed ye 28th day of March                                            1723
2 CONT                     Sarah their Daughter was born ye 14th day of August                                     1726
2 CONT                     Edward their Son was born ye 27th day of March                                            1729
2 CONT                        and Died ye Day of June                                                                                1729
2 CONT                     John Brooker ye father of ye above named Children Departed
2 CONT                        this Life the fourteenth Day of November                                                      1731
2 CONT                     Patience Daughter to John & Sarah Brooker was born May 10th                     1732
2 CONT                     John Brooker called "Junior" and "Shipwright" 14 May                                   1722
2 CONT                     John Brooker called "Junior" and "Shipwright" 14 Sept                                   1723
2 CONT                     John Brooker called "Junior" and "Shipwright" 20 Feb                                     1722/23
2 CONT                     John Brooker, shipwright, formerly of Killingworth, now a           
2 CONT                        resident of Saybrook 28 July                                                                          1726
2 CONT                     *Also 1:125 (Saybrook Colony Vital Reccords 1635- 1860 p. 6)* Reference: [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=mojopapa&id=I03533 RootsWeb's WorldConnect] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/Sm
2 CONC artCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 24 2016, 23:20:42 UTC''
