1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Philemon "Peleg" Doud, Sr. was the son of John Doud from Connecticut and and Rebecca Grinnell from Rhode Island. He married Merit Ward on 2 Jul 1752 in Killingworth, Middlesex Co, CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of:<br/>
2 CONT Lucretia Doud b: 14 Aug 1752<br/>
2 CONT Samantha Doud b: 4 Aug 1753<br/>
2 CONT Mareb Doud b: 22 Oct 1754<br/>
2 CONT John Doud b: 22 Sep 1756  <br/>
2 CONT Warren Doud b: 6 Jan 1760  <br/>
2 CONT Seymour Doud b: 22 Jul 1762 <br/>
2 CONT Philemon "Peleg" Doud Jr b: 30 Dec 1764  <br/>
2 CONT Rebecca Doud b: 2 Dec 1767  <br/>
2 CONT Edward Doud b: 6 Apr 1769 <br/>
2 CONT Marilla (Mareala) Doud b: 1771 <br/>
2 CONT Asenath Doud b: 4 Apr 1773 <br/>
2 CONT Zineg Doud b: 14 Jul 1775 <br/>
2 CONT   Betsey Doud b: 5 Sep 1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Family records indicate he was buried in this cemetery; however, no marker exists.<br/>
