2 CONC e Actor
2 CONT ** 1928 Kelsey genealogies (plus TAG 37 [1961]: 7-9, on the Wellmans),
2 CONT * 4 Williams, Alicia Crane, ed., Mayflower Families Through Five Generations: Vol. 16, Part 1, Family of John Alden, Plymouth, Massachusetts: General Society of Mayflower Descendants (1 999), 81, 293-294, transcription error with 
2 CONC first wedding date for Gideon.
