2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham II was the son of Abraham and Deborah (Barber) Chalker, born May 1, 1699[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Jemima Grinnell, daughter of Daniel and Lydia (Peabody) Grinnell, on 4 Mar 1723/4 at Saybrook, Middlesex, CT - their children were Abraham III, Jemima, Jerusha, Deborah, Elizabeth, Isaac, Jane, Sarah, Jacob and Lydia Ch
2 CONC alker
2 CONT
2 CONT He second married Lydia (Chalker) Chapman, widow of Levi Chapman and daughter of his uncle, Stephen Chalker and his wife Elizabeth Chamon.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He is buried at Cypress Cemetery, Old Saybrook, Middlesex, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Chalker-49
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Chalker II (1699 - 1783) I
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Abraham Chalker II===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1 May 1699 in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Abraham Chalker [uncertain] and Deborah (Barber) Chalker [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Hannah Chalker [half], Abraham Chalker II [half], Deborah Mary (Chalker) Bates, Sarah (Chalker) Pratt, Samuel Chalker, Hannah (Chalker) Harris, Isaac Chalker, Elizabeth Chalker and Elizabeth (Chalker) Jones
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Jemima (Grinnell) Chalker — married 4 Mar 1724 in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Lydia Chalker — married after 3 Feb 1762 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Abraham Chalker III, Jemima (Chalker) Bushnell, Jerusha (Chalker) Pratt, Deborah (Chalker) Pratt, Elizabeth (Chalker) Ingham, Isaac Chalker, Jane (Chalker) Buell, Sarah Chalker, Jacob Chalker, Lydia Chalker and Unnamed C
2 CONC halker
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 20 Sep 1783 at age 84 in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut, United Statesm
2 CONT
2 CONT Chalker-49 created 30 May 2013 | Last modified 5 Jan 2021
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
