1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jerusha Pratt (born Chalker), 1728 - 1790 Jerusha Pratt (born Chalker) was born on September 4, 1728, in Saybrook, Middlesex Co., CT, to Abraham Chalker and Jemima Chalker (born Grinnell). Abraham was born on May 1
2 CONC , 1699, in Saybrook, Middlesex Co., CT. Jemima was born on July 26, 1705, in Westbrook, Middlesex Co., CT. Jerusha had 10 siblings: Abraham Chalker, Jemima Bushnell (born Chalker), Deborah Pratt (born Chalker), Elizabeth Ingham (b
2 CONC orn Chalker), Isaac Chalker, Jane Buell (born Chalker), Sarah Chalker, Jacob Chalker, Lydia Chalker, and Daughter Chalker. Jerusha married David Pratt in 1748, at age 19. David was born in 1725, in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONC , United States of America. They had 9 children: 
2 CONT # Jasper Pratt, 
2 CONT # Abner Pratt, 
2 CONT # David Pratt, 
2 CONT # Peabody Pratt, 
2 CONT # Adonijah Pratt, 
2 CONT # Jerusha Bristol (born Pratt), 
2 CONT # Jemima Pratt, 
2 CONT # Lydia Steele (born Pratt) and 
2 CONT # Miner Pratt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerusha passed away on March 10, 1790, at age 61 in Old Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States.
