2 CONT Connecticut, Church Record Abstracts, 1630-1920 about Elisabeth Ingham Name:	Elisabeth Ingham Spouse Name:	Jonathan Ingham Death Date:	16 Mar 1791 Death Place:	Avon, Connecticut, USA Volume Title:	Volume 003 Avon
