1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Phebe Merrill, born Nov. 3, 1774 in Clinton, Killingworth, Ct.; m. with HIEL BROCKWAY, born Apr. 16,1775, on Oct. 7,1798 at the 1st Church, Killingworth. He was b. Apr. 16,1775, of Lyme, Conn. They removed to what 
2 CONC is now Brockport, New York (originally called Brockway's Port). She d. Aug. 19,1851; he on Aug. 19,1842.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: Augustus (1799), Charles (10/26/1800), Elias (8/28/1802), Alice (3/5/1804), Edward (9/25/1805), Ira (1807), Mary Ann (8/18/1808), Azubah (3/15/1810), Hiel Jr. (8/30/1811), Phebe (3/14/1813), Maria (9/9/1814), Nathan
2 CONC  (4/5/1816), and Julia (1/24/1818).
2 CONT
2 CONT Originally Brockway's Port, it was later shortened to BROCKPORT, NY.
