1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Redfield, son of Ambrose Redfield and Lois Baldwin, was born Oct. 30, 1792 in Killingworth, Middlesex Co., Connecticut; was a teacher and later of Upper Canada; m. SUSAN PRENTISS. He died in Canada in 1823 
2 CONC at the age of 31 years. His widow was afterwards married to John Cunningham, and is now living in Bastrop Co., Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: William, Henry P., and Albert
2 CONT
2 CONT These sons are said to be living in Texas, but we are unable to trace their history further.
2 CONT
2 CONT *1792 birth record: William Redfield, b 10/30/1792 in Killingworth, Middlesex Co., Conn.; s/o Ambrose & Lois Redfield
2 CONT
