2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Burnett was born in 1645, in Southampton, Suffolk, New York Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Thomas Alexander Burnett, was 33 and his mother, Mary Cooper, was 24. He married Deborah Rogers on 13 July 1695, i
2 CONC n Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He lived in Perth Amboy, Middlesex, New Jersey, United States in 1739 and Suffolk, New York, United S
2 CONC tates in 1657. He died on 28 March 1739, in Middlesex, Middlesex, New Jersey, United States, at the age of 94, and was buried in Leeds, Yorkshire, England, United Kingdom.
