2 CONT Name Meaning
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Burnett
2 CONT
2 CONT John
2 CONT Scottish and Irish (Tyrone and Antrim): descriptive nickname of Norman origin, from Old French burnete, a diminutive of brun ‘brown’ (see Brown ), or possibly in some instances a metonymic occupational name for a maker or seller o
2 CONC f burnete, a high quality woolen cloth, originally dark brown in color.
2 CONT MORE
2 CONT Probably also an altered form of English Barnett .
2 CONT In some cases also an altered form of French Burnet ; compare Burnette .
2 CONT Dictionary of American Family Names © Patrick Hanks 2003, 2006.
