1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her immigrant father, https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Burnett/6000000008631711147?through=6000000003221122361, was a husbandman (looked after animals).  It is not likely he was the son of https://www.geni.com/pe
2 CONC ople/Thomas-Burnet-M-A-of-Cambridge/6000000002244359403
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Disputed lineage 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Alexander Burnett Jr. and Granddaughter of Dr. Thomas Alexander Burnett, M.A. of Cambridge, Sr. and his wife Jane Foys of London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also the great granddaughter of Alexander Burnett, 11th Laird of Leys and his wife and 1st cousin Katherine Arbuthnot of Aberdeenshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas' wife Katherine is also a direct descendant of every other Kings and Queen of Europe including Asia.. A few of her ancestors are Robert the Bruce, Edward III of England, James II of Scotland and a few others.
2 CONT
