2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Whilldin-7
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah (Whilldin) Leaming, daughter of Hannah (Gorham) Whilldin, daughter of Desire (Howland) Gorham, daughter of John Howland, the pilgrim, "was born at Yarmouth, Plymouth Colony, 1683, died at Cape May, 1728, married first at Ca
2 CONC pe May, 18, June 1701, Thomas Leaming, born at Southampton, Long Island 9 July 1572, died at Cape May, 31 December 1723. She married second Philip Syng of Philadelphia."[1]
