2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy LEAMING - Born on 10 Sep 1704 in Cape May, Cape May Co., NJ. Mercy died in Cape May, Cape May Co., NJ, in 1769; she was 64. In 1730 when Mercy was 25, she first married Samuel ELDREDGE, son of Ezekiel ELDREDGE & Sarah HAND. 
2 CONC Born ca 1699. Samuel died in Mar 1745/1746; he was 46. They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Priscilla 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Samuel (ca1730-1796) 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.  Aaron (1733-1775) 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.  Jacob (ca1740-) 
2 CONT
2 CONT v.  Sarah (1742-) 
2 CONT
2 CONT vi.  Jeremiah (Posthumous) (1745-1795)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~sam/leaming.html#P3638 
